              "item_label": "Mag Cell",
              "dialog": [
                {
                  "speaker": "Elio",
                  "text": "That's all four! The cells are resonating together. I can feel it through the case."
                },
                {
                  "speaker": "Elio",
                  "text": "Hold still. I'm fitting the cells into the housing..."
                },
                {
                  "speaker": "",
                  "text": "The four cells lock together. Light pulses through the seams, faster and faster, then the new Mag rises and drifts toward Elio."
                },
                {
                  "speaker": "Elio",
                  "text": "There you are. Welcome to the family."
                },
                {
                  "speaker": "Elio",
                  "text": "I'll raise this one for the guild. When it's ready, it'll find its hunter, just like yours found you."
                },
                {
                  "speaker": "Elio",
                  "text": "Thank you for the escort. Let's head back."
                }
              ],
